# goDTA report: godta_it_golden on lab01

## Context

- Server: lab01, SQL Server 16.0.4250.1 (major 16, RTM), Developer Edition (64-bit)
- Database: godta_it_golden, compatibility level 160, Query Store READ_WRITE
- Workload source: Query Store, from 2026-11-07 08:00:00 to 2026-11-08 08:00:00 (UTC)
- Capture mode: ALL
- Queries read: 5, writes: 1
- Score formula: gain = sum((before - after) x executions); maintenance = sum(operator cost x executions); recommended when gain >= 10% of the cost and maintenance <= gain / 2
- Costs are the optimizer's estimated costs, in its own units; a gain is a cost difference times executions.

